Blocks Become Text
1. Introduction
Blocks Become Text is the retooling week of the Joy of Computing course. The logic that students previously built using Scratch blocks is now recreated in EduBlocks, where every block automatically generates the equivalent Python code beside it. The objective is to help students understand that they are not learning a completely new language; they are simply seeing the same programming logic represented as text.

Key Points
Scratch logic is converted into Python code.

EduBlocks displays Python alongside the blocks.

Students learn the relationship between visual programming and text programming.

This is the first step toward writing Python independently.


